Tokimi's Toolshed for Sunrise (version 0.1.0)

A port of Tokimi's Toolshed 1.8 by Tokimi, CozyStudios.
Original source: https://github.com/CozyCord/TokimisToolshed
Original licence: CC0-1.0

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko: what the tools do is re-implemented in Rust on Sunrise's typed mod
API (no Java code is included, and the package declares no native mixin). The items' data in data/,
the models, textures and translations in assets/ are the original release's, and icon.png is made
from four of its textures. This port is distributed under the same licence as the original
(CC0-1.0); the licence text is in LICENSE.

LICENSE is the CC0-1.0 text (the jar names CC0-1.0 and has no licence file).
